	(text "BLOCK 4C - FIXED UNDERSIDE MICROSD STORAGE EXTENSION\n\nJ402: Adafruit microSD BFF, Product 5683 / supplier reference ADA5683\n3.3 V SPI; factory TX-to-CS jumper closed; RX/A0/A1 alternatives open\nRequired hand-fitted part: DNP for AISLER assembly\nOrient CARD ACCESS toward the harness-card top edge"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 497.84 102.87 0)
