	(text "* Target GPIO communicates through the routing fabric \nusing TI_ONEWIRE_DQ.\n\n* J501, J502 and J504 are all connected to that same bus.\n    - J501 and J502 connect the two DS18B20 temperature sensors.\n    - J504 connects the DS2413 GPIO module.\n\n* DS2413 provides two separate GPIO output paths.\n    R503 and R504 pull the two open-drain PIO signals high when\n    the DS2413 releases them. \n    R505 and R506 provide series protection if a target \n    feedback pin is accidentally configured as an output."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 375.92 350.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "565f055f-d218-45b2-ae94-187eb48007da")
	)
	(text "EXTERNAL STIMULUS AT J201: 0–3.3 V ONLY\nRemove JP201 before connecting the external source.\nJP202 and JP203 independently connect the target ADC and MCP3008 CH0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 496.57 54.61 0)
		(effects
